# Research for the quiver's place and motion (reports/archery/2026-11-04-quiver-mount/research.md): the hero in
# light leather walking with the bow on the back. First the swing as it is (the angle in metrics.csv: qv_swing,
# qv_back, qv_outward; slowmo 2, a row is 1/60 s of the game), walking and running; then the quiver held at rest
# (`quiver still on`) in the candidate places (`quiver place`), walking, from the right side and from behind on
# the right: frames, not clips (the hand at the hip mid-step is picked from them). qv_arm: cm the arm goes in
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091   # flat open ground
face -106
wait 500
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
equip ITAR_Leather_L
arrows player 20
cam look 95
slowmo 2
wait 600
walkmode walk
cam follow 230 100 -90
wait 300
rec swing_walk
hold forward 4200
wait 4000
stop
release all
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
face -106
wait 400
walkmode run
rec swing_run
hold forward 3200
wait 3000
stop
release all
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
face -106
wait 400
walkmode walk
quiver still on

# --- now
quiver place off
cam follow 230 100 -90
wait 200
hold forward 2600
wait 800
rec place_now_side
wait 1100
stop
release all
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
face -106
wait 400
cam follow 230 110 -140
wait 200
hold forward 2600
wait 800
rec place_now_backside
wait 1100
stop
release all
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
face -106
wait 400

